    "evaluation": "Henderson is a lean 6-4 EDGE who explodes off the ball with first-step burst, shows bend to flatten the arc, and stays disciplined when the pocket collapses. Wins with burst and bend before the frame fills — a JACK/EDGE mold with every-down upside as he adds mass.",
